                                                "sense_id": "4a371b3a-e2c5-312f-be2f-7a7cd46caea6",
                                                "text": "The dictionaries themselves cover this additional lexis in what can best be described as a piecemeal fashion, with an obvious but unwarranted bias towards colonial era lexis."
